This workspace is a Local Private BoI folder.

- Start from `data/boi/index.md` and folder `index.md` files.
- Do not scan everything first unless broad cleanup/search is requested.
- Save personal BoI documents under `data/boi/private/me/`.
- Required metadata includes `visibility: local-private`, `local_only: true`, `promotion_status`, lifecycle fields, and `source_refs`.
- Update `index.md` and `log.md` after changes.
- Run self-check before completion. Use `check.sh` or `check.ps1` if available.
- MCP is optional. If not available, use local files and user-provided sources.
- Never send Local Private originals remotely without explicit user confirmation.

